# Own the private lifecycle of one ordinary streaming child process.
# Authority: pipe setup, start, no-reap observation, first cause, bounded teardown,
# process-group cleanup with actual-delivery tracking, sole final wait, and cached completion.
# Required regressions: native errno from one negative-PGID call; EPERM plus leader ESRCH is
# non-delivery; exact natural exit 17; only actually delivered SIGKILL is suppressed;
# observer/context workers join; setup rollback retries EINTR then falls back on EPERM;
# caller-owned non-nil SysProcAttr is rejected before mutation.
# Exception: hard 2/1/1150 ceiling approved before work; behavior-proven payload must remain
# at or below 785 changed lines and stop/re-plan at 325 production lines.
# Dependency: closed RK1UO native exit observer commit 19fabd7.
# Deferred: public adapters (RK1ULA), privileged sudo (RK1P).
version=2
slice_id=rk1ulk-private-lifecycle-kernel-v4
state=contract-frozen
max_total_files=2
max_production_files=1
max_changed_lines=1150
exception=before-the-fact-hard-ceiling-for-behavior-proven-private-lifecycle-kernel
ignore=tasks/pi-agent-integration-spec.md
allow=internal/runner/streaming_lifecycle.go
allow=internal/runner/streaming_lifecycle_test.go
allow=tasks/slice-commit-ledger.tsv
test=internal/runner/streaming_lifecycle_test.go
